---
import DownloadIcon from './icons/DownloadIcon.astro';
---

<section id="inicio" class="panel hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title" data-reveal-section>
  <div class="portrait-wrap">
    <img src="/assets/portrait-enzo.png" width="720" height="720" alt="Retrato de Enzo Jesuan Del Sole" />
  </div>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 id="hero-title">
      <span class="lang-es">Hola, soy</span><span class="lang-en">Hi, I am</span>
      <strong>Enzo Jesuan Del Sole</strong>
    </h1>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <span class="role"><span class="lang-es">Desarrollador Full Stack</span><span class="lang-en">Full Stack Developer</span></span>
      <a class="cv-button" href="/cv-enzo-del-sole.pdf" download>
        <DownloadIcon />
        <span class="lang-es">Descargar CV</span><span class="lang-en">Download résumé</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="lang-es">Me enfoco en resolver problemas con lógica, criterio y fundamentos técnicos sólidos. Busco comprender cada desafío, construir soluciones claras y adaptarme a las tecnologías que mejor respondan a las necesidades del proyecto.</p>
    <p class="lang-en">I focus on solving problems with logic, criteria, and solid technical fundamentals. I aim to understand each challenge, build clear solutions, and adapt to the technologies that best respond to the needs of the project.</p>
  </div>
</section>
